      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا أَقْشَبَ بَيْتَهُمْ</span></b>  <i>How unclean, dirty,</i> or <i>filthy,
is their tent</i> or <i>house!</i> (O,) or, <i>what surrounds
their tent</i> or <i>house, by reason of the human excrement,</i> or <i>ordure!</i> (TA.)

